      "sourceTextSha256": "fc87d6d5908463da0f320e2a7226de9041f8d256e01d92d766a3f36b2da9eaa1",
      "text": "## Prices per person (USD) · group tour\n\n| CATEGORY | SGL | DBL | TPL |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Hotels 3★ | $ 6,680 | $ 5,215 | $ 5,208 |\n| Hotels 4★ | $ 7,550 | $ 5,590 | $ 5,335 |\n| Hotels 5★ | $ 8,980 | $ 6,470 | $ 6,065 |\n\nRates per person, including domestic flights, the Champions Parade ticket and transfers.\n\n10D / 9N · 12 – 21 February 2027\n\nHotel names to be confirmed; hotels may be replaced by others of the same category.\n\nProgramme and services subject to final confirmation.\n\n## Optional excursions at an additional cost\n\nOptional experiences in Rio de Janeiro, Iguazu, Buenos Aires and Santiago.\n\n| EXCURSION | PRICE | DESCRIPTION |\n|---|---|---|\n| Marius restaurant | Around USD 130 per person | Seafood in the evening. |\n| Samba show | USD 120 per person | Rio de Janeiro · evening. Show only; transfers on request. |\n| Guanabara Bay by boat | USD 230 per person | Group boat, min. 2, with guide; transfers included. |\n| Secrets of Old Rio | USD 170 per person | Rio de Janeiro · 4 hours. Private, min. 2, English-speaking guide. Confeitaria Colombo: food and drinks not included. |\n| Helicopter flight | Price on request | Rio de Janeiro · 6–13 minutes. |\n| Botanical Garden | USD 200 per person | Private, min. 2, English-speaking guide. |\n| Favela tour | USD 90 p.p. (group) / USD 170 p.p. private, min. 2 | A jeep tour of Rocinha and a local guide. |\n| Hang gliding | USD 390 per person | Transfers and GoPro recording included. A tandem flight with a professional English-speaking instructor. |\n| Rafain show | USD 95 per person | Drinks not included. |\n| Macuco Safari | USD 135 per person in the day programme / USD 130 per person in Optional excursions | With the Brazilian Falls tour. |\n| Bird Park | USD 65 per person in the day programme / USD 55 per person in Optional excursions | With the Brazilian Falls tour. |\n| Helicopter over the falls | USD 170 per person in the day programme / USD 250 per person in Optional excursions | Optional excursions: Foz do Iguaçu · 10 minutes. Minimum 3 people. |\n| Tigre & northern suburbs | USD 100 per person | Group, English-speaking guide. San Isidro and Tigre, with a boat trip. |\n| Montevideo, Uruguay | USD 500 p.p. (group) / Private: USD 850 p.p., min. 2; ferry included | Buenos Aires · full day. |\n| Fiesta Gaucha | USD 350 per person | Buenos Aires · 8 hours. Group; traditional lunch included. |\n| Maipo Valley wineries | USD 230 per person | Minimum 2 people. A visit to the wineries of the Maipo Valley, with a tasting. |\n",
